    "ruleType": "enhancement",
    "group": "Pactbound Zealots",
    "summary": "As the Fight phase ends, roll a D6 separately for every enemy unit 3″ or closer to the bearer. Apply a +1 to these rolls only after a same-phase Dark Pact by the unit carrying this enhancement, with no failed Leadership test for that Pact. Each enemy unit whose result is 4+ takes D3 mortal wounds.",
